                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3212fe48-ab44-3d93-b222-6420ea404750",
                        "entry_id": "ae301d46-b92f-36a3-84b1-e29c783eab43",
                        "glosses": [
                            "гастрон. традиционное блюдо итальянской кухни, особенно города Болонья, приготовленное из слоёв теста вперемешку со слоями начинки, залитых соусами бешамель и болоньезе (также возможны другие соусы и начинки)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "732d9a77-e969-45ec-9ef7-27c259e9d045",
                                "sense_id": "3212fe48-ab44-3d93-b222-6420ea404750",
                                "text": "Лазанья с курицей и шпинатом"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09729923-b319-4c3e-bb9c-9b43898bf779",
                                "sense_id": "3212fe48-ab44-3d93-b222-6420ea404750",
                                "text": "Сегодня на ужин у нас была лазанья"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "51efb57c-bf12-441e-b336-122669a7ca30",
                                "sense_id": "3212fe48-ab44-3d93-b222-6420ea404750",
                                "text": "Алексей свёл меня в ресторан итальянской кухни и стал угощать. Ели вкусную лазанью."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c624fe72-119c-36f5-8964-5a597520b802",
                        "entry_id": "ae301d46-b92f-36a3-84b1-e29c783eab43",
                        "glosses": [
                            "кулин. макаронные изделия, широкие пластины из тонкораскатанного теста для приготовления лазаньи [1]"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "059b721b-88ec-4194-a3e3-302eaf682a56",
                                "sense_id": "c624fe72-119c-36f5-8964-5a597520b802",
                                "text": "Листы лазаньи"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4573e73-320a-4e1f-9a3c-5d3deee41dee",
                        "source_entry_id": "ae301d46-b92f-36a3-84b1-e29c783eab43",
                        "target_lang_word": "lasagna",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lasagna",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63513df5-0ee3-3aad-832b-0645674c0b35",
                                        "entry_id": "f2763edf-b4e6-3791-a766-4f66c0e93ca9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A flat sheet of pasta."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e49575a-6438-34a2-a73f-0cf0fda7e22a",
                                        "entry_id": "f2763edf-b4e6-3791-a766-4f66c0e93ca9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An Italian baked dish comprising layers of such pasta with various ingredients (usually a meat ragù (chiefly Bolognese), a fish ragù or a vegetarian/vegetable ragù with bechamel sauce)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5068268-60ab-49e1-93d9-2c645c50da83",
                                                "sense_id": "9e49575a-6438-34a2-a73f-0cf0fda7e22a",
                                                "text": "I’m going to fix you a cup of coffee and a plate of lasagna."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc3175e1-3760-368a-b73a-39d77d5dc434",
                                        "entry_id": "f2763edf-b4e6-3791-a766-4f66c0e93ca9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A combination or layering of things."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d383db29-689b-42f6-b900-44f31bbe1537",
                                                "sense_id": "cc3175e1-3760-368a-b73a-39d77d5dc434",
                                                "text": "Kristofer'd gotten it through his head shortly after their arrival to swim naked in the lake, such as it was, and his skin blemished into a lasagna of red hives, white welts, and disarming yellowish spots."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "827b45dd-a8ed-4e2b-b04a-4a3f5c1d14e2",
                                                "sense_id": "cc3175e1-3760-368a-b73a-39d77d5dc434",
                                                "text": "Unfortunately, typical mattresses are often a lasagna of nonbiodegradable synthetics, pesticides, and potentially carcinogenic toxins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0553cdb5-bb23-40f1-9639-fc361f763c0f",
                                                "sense_id": "cc3175e1-3760-368a-b73a-39d77d5dc434",
                                                "text": "It's sort of a lasagna of ideas about time and dreams."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10628c5f-8267-4f82-bd96-39b0cbb07528",
                                                "sense_id": "cc3175e1-3760-368a-b73a-39d77d5dc434",
                                                "text": "“Everything about us is just one layer of lies after another. We're a lasagna of lies. This is a terrible basis for a relationship.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c46df4b8-bf22-4ee3-a974-e5597b076f4e",
                                                "sense_id": "cc3175e1-3760-368a-b73a-39d77d5dc434",
                                                "text": "CHOCOLATE LASAGNA / Who says lasagna is only a main dish? Serve this easy, no-bake lasagna for dessert. / Ingredients / 2 3.9-ounce packages (110 g) instant chocolate pudding mix / 2 cups (473 mL) milk / 8 ounces (227g) whipped topping / 16 graham crackers, chocolate or plan / 1 1/2 cups (75g) mini marshmallows / chocolate syrup"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
